  <description>
    <p>
      Aulos is a modern, feature-rich music player built with the COSMIC
      desktop SDK. It features a clean album-focused interface with support
      for multiple audio formats, MPD and Subsonic/OpenSubsonic backends,
      embedded cover art, lyrics display, and CSD playback controls in the
      title bar.
